<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="京扇きもの教室 水戸店の教室紹介。教室の雰囲気、レッスン風景、講師、アクセス、きものでお出かけのイメージをご紹介します。">
  <title>水戸店 | 教室紹介 | 京扇きもの教室</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #fbf9f4;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --ink: #27231f;
      --muted: #746e67;
      --line: #ded8cf;
      --soft: #f2eee7;
      --accent: #8f2634;
      --accent-dark: #6f1925;
      --accent-soft: #f4e7e9;
      --gold: #a88d61;
      --green: #435648;
      --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(45, 36, 29, 0.08);
      --radius: 18px;
      --container: 1180px;
      --header-height: 82px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--bg);
      font-family: "Noto Sans JP", "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Yu Gothic", Meiryo, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.8;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    body.menu-open {
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    button,
    input,
    textarea,
    select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--container));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section {
      position: relative;
      padding: 112px 0;
    }

    .section--white {
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .section--soft {
      background: var(--soft);
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 54px;
    }

    .section-head__main {
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      width: 32px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: currentColor;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    p {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    .serif {
      font-family: "Noto Serif JP", "Yu Mincho", "Hiragino Mincho ProN", serif;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: clamp(31px, 4vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.45;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .lead {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 54px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 0 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn::after {
      content: "→";
      transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn:hover::after {
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .btn--accent {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn--accent:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-dark);
      background: var(--accent-dark);
    }

    .btn--ghost-white {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn--ghost-white:hover {
      border-color: #fff;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .image-placeholder {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 280px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #d2cbc2;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ece7df, #ece7df 14px, #f5f2ec 14px, #f5f2ec 28px);
      color: #6f6860;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .image-placeholder__inner {
      max-width: 440px;
    }

    .image-placeholder__label {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #bdb5aa;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.74);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }

    .image-placeholder strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #4c4741;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .image-placeholder p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       Shared header: 下層ページでも共通利用を想定
    ====================================================== */
    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      z-index: 1000;
      top: 0;
      height: var(--header-height);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(39, 35, 31, 0.08);
      background: rgba(251, 249, 244, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .site-header__inner {
      display: flex;
      width: min(calc(100% - 40px), 1380px);
      height: 100%;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand__mark {
      display: grid;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .brand__text strong,
    .brand__text small {
      display: block;
    }

    .brand__text strong {
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .brand__text small {
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .global-nav {
      display: flex;
      min-width: 0;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .global-nav__links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 26px);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .global-nav__links a {
      position: relative;
      padding: 8px 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .global-nav__links a::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 2px;
      left: 0;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: var(--accent);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: right;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .global-nav__links a:hover::after {
      transform: scaleX(1);
      transform-origin: left;
    }

    .global-nav__cta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .header-cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 44px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .header-cta--accent {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--ink);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .menu-toggle span,
    .menu-toggle::before,
    .menu-toggle::after {
      position: absolute;
      width: 19px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: #fff;
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .menu-toggle::before {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
    }

    .menu-toggle::after {
      transform: translateY(6px);
    }

    .menu-toggle.is-open span {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .menu-toggle.is-open::before {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .menu-toggle.is-open::after {
      transform: rotate(-45deg);
    }

    .mobile-menu {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 990;
      top: var(--header-height);
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      display: none;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 36px 24px 48px;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .mobile-menu.is-open {
      display: block;
    }

    .mobile-menu__nav {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .mobile-menu__nav a {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 18px 4px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .mobile-menu__nav a::after {
      content: "→";
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: sans-serif;
    }

    .mobile-menu__cta {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .mobile-menu__cta .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       Hero
    ====================================================== */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: calc(100svh - var(--header-height));
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #efe8df;
    }

    .hero__grid {
      display: grid;
      min-height: calc(100svh - var(--header-height));
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    }

    .hero__content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 80px max(44px, calc((100vw - var(--container)) / 2));
      padding-right: 48px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 0 0, rgba(143, 38, 52, 0.08), transparent 38%),
        var(--bg);
    }

    .hero__content-inner {
      max-width: 580px;
    }

    .hero__tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .hero__tag::before {
      width: 26px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: currentColor;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.45;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .hero__lead {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      color: #5f5952;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 2.1;
    }

    .hero__actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .hero__visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 620px;
    }

    .hero__visual .image-placeholder {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      border: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(92, 72, 54, 0.12), rgba(255,255,255,0.08)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #dcd2c5, #dcd2c5 16px, #e9e1d7 16px, #e9e1d7 32px);
    }

    .hero__visual .image-placeholder__inner {
      padding: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
    }

    .hero__note {
      position: absolute;
      right: 24px;
      bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      max-width: 260px;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: rgba(39,35,31,0.86);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero__note strong {
      color: #e0c79e;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .scroll-cue {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 3;
      bottom: 22px;
      left: 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: #777067;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    }

    /* intro */
    .intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 84px;
    }

    .intro-copy h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 52px);
    }

    .intro-copy p {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 2.25;
    }

    .intro-visual {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.62fr;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .intro-visual .image-placeholder:first-child {
      min-height: 520px;
    }

    .intro-visual .image-placeholder:last-child {
      min-height: 320px;
      transform: translateY(42px);
    }

    /* features */
    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      position: relative;
      padding: 38px 30px 34px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    }

    .feature-card__no {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    /* lesson */
    .lesson-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .lesson-card {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--paper);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .lesson-card .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 290px;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .lesson-card__body {
      padding: 30px 32px 34px;
    }

    .lesson-card__tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .lesson-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .lesson-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .lesson-card__meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 22px 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .lesson-card__meta li {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fcfbf9;
      color: #5e5851;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .section-foot {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 44px;
    }

    /* steps */
    .step-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
    }

    .step-item {
      min-height: 260px;
      padding: 32px 26px;
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .step-item__num {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .step-item h3 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .step-item p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    /* school */
    .school-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .school-layout > .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 560px;
    }

    .school-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .school-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 78px 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .school-item:hover {
      border-color: #bbb1a3;
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    .school-item__pref {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .school-item__name {
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .school-item__arrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    /* teacher */
    .teacher-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 80px;
    }

    .teacher-layout .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 580px;
      border-radius: 180px 180px 0 0;
    }

    .teacher-copy blockquote {
      margin: 28px 0;
      padding: 0 0 0 26px;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--accent);
      color: #4d4740;
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    /* voice */
    .voice-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .voice-card {
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .voice-card__meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .voice-card__avatar {
      display: grid;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--soft);
      color: #8e867d;
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .voice-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .voice-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    /* faq */
    .faq-list {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .faq-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .faq-button {
      display: grid;
      width: 100%;
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr 30px;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 24px 4px;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-align: left;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .faq-q {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .faq-button strong {
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .faq-icon {
      position: relative;
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
    }

    .faq-icon::before,
    .faq-icon::after {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 13px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: var(--ink);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .faq-icon::after {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg);
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .faq-item.is-open .faq-icon::after {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      display: none;
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 0 4px 28px;
    }

    .faq-item.is-open .faq-answer {
      display: grid;
    }

    .faq-a {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .faq-answer p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .closing-cta {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--green);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .closing-cta::before {
      position: absolute;
      top: -80px;
      right: -80px;
      width: 320px;
      height: 320px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
    }

    .closing-cta__inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 56px;
    }

    .closing-cta .eyebrow {
      color: #e1c9a2;
    }

    .closing-cta h2 {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
    }

    .closing-cta p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .closing-cta__buttons {
      display: grid;
      min-width: 260px;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .closing-cta__buttons .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* =====================================================
       Shared footer: 下層ページでも共通利用を想定
    ====================================================== */
    .site-footer {
      background: #201e1b;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .site-footer__main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
      gap: 70px;
      padding: 70px 0 56px;
    }

    .footer-brand .brand {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .footer-brand .brand__mark {
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    }

    .footer-brand .brand__text small {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.54);
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      max-width: 360px;
      margin: 28px 0 0;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .footer-nav {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px 44px;
    }

    .footer-nav a {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-nav a::after {
      content: "↗";
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .site-footer__bottom {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 24px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .back-to-top {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    }

    /* fixed mobile CTA */
    .sp-fixed-cta {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 900;
      right: 12px;
      bottom: 12px;
      left: 12px;
      display: none;
      grid-template-columns: 0.82fr 1.18fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(39,35,31,0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(39,35,31,0.15);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .sp-fixed-cta a {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 46px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .sp-fixed-cta a:last-child {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1180px) {
      .global-nav__links {
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .global-nav__links a {
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .header-cta {
        padding: 0 12px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      :root {
        --header-height: 72px;
      }

      .global-nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .menu-toggle {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
      }

      .hero__grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero__content {
        min-height: 560px;
        padding: 76px max(28px, calc((100vw - 760px) / 2));
      }

      .hero__visual {
        min-height: 560px;
      }

      .scroll-cue {
        display: none;
      }

      .intro-grid,
      .teacher-layout,
      .school-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
      }

      .intro-visual {
        max-width: 760px;
      }

      .feature-grid,
      .voice-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .step-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .school-layout > .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 420px;
      }

      .teacher-layout .image-placeholder {
        max-width: 680px;
        min-height: 520px;
      }

      .closing-cta__inner {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .closing-cta__buttons {
        display: flex;
        min-width: 0;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .closing-cta__buttons .btn {
        width: auto;
      }

      .site-footer__main {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 44px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .container {
        width: min(calc(100% - 32px), var(--container));
      }

      .section {
        padding: 78px 0;
      }

      .section-head {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 34px;
      }

      .section-head .btn {
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .site-header__inner {
        width: calc(100% - 28px);
      }

      .brand__mark {
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
      }

      .brand__text strong {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .brand__text small {
        font-size: 8px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .hero__grid {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .hero__content {
        min-height: 520px;
        padding: 62px 24px 66px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(38px, 12vw, 54px);
      }

      .hero__lead {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .hero__actions .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .hero__visual {
        min-height: 460px;
      }

      .hero__note {
        right: 14px;
        bottom: 14px;
        left: 14px;
        max-width: none;
      }

      .intro-grid {
        gap: 36px;
      }

      .intro-visual {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .intro-visual .image-placeholder:first-child,
      .intro-visual .image-placeholder:last-child {
        min-height: 360px;
        transform: none;
      }

      .intro-visual .image-placeholder:last-child {
        display: none;
      }

      .feature-grid,
      .lesson-grid,
      .voice-grid,
      .step-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .feature-card {
        padding: 30px 4px;
      }

      .feature-card__no {
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .lesson-card__body {
        padding: 24px 22px 28px;
      }

      .step-item {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .school-layout > .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 340px;
      }

      .school-item {
        grid-template-columns: 58px 1fr auto;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 18px 14px;
      }

      .school-item__name {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .teacher-layout .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 430px;
        border-radius: 120px 120px 0 0;
      }

      .teacher-copy blockquote {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .faq-button {
        grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr 24px;
      }

      .faq-button strong {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .faq-answer {
        grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr;
      }

      .closing-cta__buttons {
        display: grid;
      }

      .closing-cta__buttons .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .site-footer__main {
        padding-top: 58px;
      }

      .footer-nav {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 0;
      }

      .site-footer__bottom {
        display: block;
        padding-bottom: 92px;
      }

      .back-to-top {
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .sp-fixed-cta {
        display: grid;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }




    /* =====================================================
       SCHOOL PAGE / 教室紹介ページ固有スタイル
    ====================================================== */
    .global-nav__links a[aria-current="page"]::after {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    .mobile-menu__nav a[aria-current="page"] {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .breadcrumb {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .breadcrumb__inner {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 54px;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .breadcrumb__inner a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .breadcrumb__sep {
      color: #b4aca2;
    }

    .page-hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .page-hero::before {
      position: absolute;
      top: -180px;
      left: -120px;
      width: 460px;
      height: 460px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(143, 38, 52, 0.10);
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
    }

    .page-hero__grid {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 590px;
      grid-template-columns: 0.88fr 1.12fr;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .page-hero__copy {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 86px 64px 86px max(44px, calc((100vw - var(--container)) / 2));
    }

    .page-hero__copy-inner {
      max-width: 580px;
    }

    .page-hero__en {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .page-hero h1 {
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
      line-height: 1.45;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .page-hero__lead {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 2.15;
    }

    .page-hero__visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 590px;
    }

    .page-hero__visual .image-placeholder {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      border: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(89, 67, 51, 0.10), rgba(255,255,255,0.08)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ded5ca, #ded5ca 16px, #ebe4db 16px, #ebe4db 32px);
    }

    .page-hero__visual .image-placeholder__inner {
      max-width: 470px;
      padding: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.74);
      backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
    }

    .page-hero__caption {
      position: absolute;
      right: 24px;
      bottom: 24px;
      max-width: 300px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: rgba(39,35,31,0.86);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .page-hero__caption strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      color: #e0c79e;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .school-intro {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 84px;
    }

    .school-intro__copy h2 {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 50px);
    }

    .school-intro__copy p {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 2.2;
    }

    .school-intro__note {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      color: #5c4b4e;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .school-jump {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--line);
    }

    .school-jump a {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 142px;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 22px 20px 18px;
      background: var(--paper);
      transition: 0.22s ease;
    }

    .school-jump a:hover {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .school-jump__area {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      transition: color 0.22s ease;
    }

    .school-jump a:hover .school-jump__area {
      color: #f0ccd2;
    }

    .school-jump strong {
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", "Noto Serif JP", serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .school-jump__arrow {
      align-self: flex-end;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 18px;
      transition: color 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
    }

    .school-jump a:hover .school-jump__arrow {
      color: #fff;
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .school-index-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .school-index-head p {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .school-cards {
      display: grid;
      gap: 34px;
    }

    .school-card {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 470px;
      grid-template-columns: 1.04fr 0.96fr;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
      scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 28px);
    }

    .school-card:nth-child(even) {
      grid-template-columns: 0.96fr 1.04fr;
    }

    .school-card:nth-child(even) .school-card__visual {
      order: 2;
    }

    .school-card:nth-child(even) .school-card__body {
      order: 1;
    }

    .school-card__visual {
      min-height: 470px;
    }

    .school-card__visual .image-placeholder {
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 470px;
      border: 0;
    }

    .school-card__body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 50px 52px;
    }

    .school-card__meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .school-card__meta::before {
      width: 28px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: currentColor;
    }

    .school-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .school-card__lead {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #514b45;
      font-family: "Yu Mincho", "Noto Serif JP", serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .school-card__text {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .school-card__facts {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0;
      margin: 0 0 26px;
      padding: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      list-style: none;
    }

    .school-card__facts li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .school-card__facts strong {
      color: #514b45;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .school-card__actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .school-card__actions .btn {
      min-height: 50px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .choice-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .choice-card {
      min-height: 300px;
      padding: 36px 30px 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.66);
    }

    .choice-card__no {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .choice-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .choice-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .detail-preview {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.86fr 1.14fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 78px;
    }

    .detail-preview__visual {
      min-height: 520px;
    }

    .detail-preview__visual .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 520px;
      border-radius: 180px 180px 0 0;
    }

    .detail-preview h2 {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-size: clamp(31px, 4vw, 48px);
    }

    .detail-preview__list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      background: var(--line);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .detail-preview__item {
      min-height: 150px;
      padding: 24px;
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .detail-preview__item span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .detail-preview__item h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .detail-preview__item p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .page-hero__grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .page-hero__copy {
        min-height: 460px;
        padding: 72px max(28px, calc((100vw - 760px) / 2));
      }

      .page-hero__visual {
        min-height: 520px;
      }

      .school-intro,
      .detail-preview {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 50px;
      }

      .school-jump {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      }

      .school-card,
      .school-card:nth-child(even) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .school-card:nth-child(even) .school-card__visual,
      .school-card:nth-child(even) .school-card__body {
        order: initial;
      }

      .school-card__visual,
      .school-card__visual .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 390px;
      }

      .choice-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .detail-preview__visual {
        max-width: 700px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .breadcrumb__inner {
        min-height: 48px;
        overflow: hidden;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .page-hero__copy {
        min-height: 390px;
        padding: 58px 24px 62px;
      }

      .page-hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(36px, 11vw, 50px);
      }

      .page-hero__lead {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .page-hero__visual {
        min-height: 410px;
      }

      .page-hero__caption {
        right: 14px;
        bottom: 14px;
        left: 14px;
        max-width: none;
      }

      .school-intro {
        gap: 32px;
      }

      .school-jump {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .school-jump a {
        min-height: 92px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
      }

      .school-index-head {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .school-index-head p {
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .school-cards {
        gap: 22px;
      }

      .school-card__visual,
      .school-card__visual .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 300px;
      }

      .school-card__body {
        padding: 32px 22px 34px;
      }

      .school-card__lead {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .school-card__facts li {
        grid-template-columns: 76px 1fr;
      }

      .school-card__actions {
        display: grid;
      }

      .school-card__actions .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .choice-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .choice-card {
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 30px 4px;
      }

      .choice-card__no {
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .detail-preview__visual,
      .detail-preview__visual .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 400px;
      }

      .detail-preview__visual .image-placeholder {
        border-radius: 120px 120px 0 0;
      }

      .detail-preview__list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

  

    /* =====================================================
       School detail / 水戸店 個別ページ
    ====================================================== */
    .store-hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .store-hero__grid {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 610px;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(520px, 1.1fr);
    }

    .store-hero__copy {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 70px 7vw 78px max(48px, calc((100vw - var(--container)) / 2));
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .store-hero__copy-inner {
      max-width: 570px;
    }

    .store-hero__area {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    }

    .store-hero__area::before {
      width: 34px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: currentColor;
    }

    .store-hero h1 {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 78px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    .store-hero__sub {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }

    .store-hero__lead {
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 2.15;
    }

    .store-hero__actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .store-hero__visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 610px;
    }

    .store-hero__visual .image-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 610px;
      border: 0;
    }

    .store-hero__badge {
      position: absolute;
      right: 28px;
      bottom: 28px;
      width: min(285px, calc(100% - 56px));
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.58);
      background: rgba(35,32,28,0.82);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .store-hero__badge strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: #e9d9bc;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }

    .store-facts {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      margin-top: -1px;
      background: var(--paper);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .store-facts__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .store-fact {
      min-height: 124px;
      padding: 26px 26px 24px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .store-fact:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .store-fact span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .store-fact strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .store-fact p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .store-intro {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: 78px;
    }

    .store-intro__visual {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.62fr;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .store-intro__visual .image-placeholder:first-child {
      min-height: 560px;
    }

    .store-intro__visual .image-placeholder:last-child {
      min-height: 320px;
      margin-bottom: -42px;
    }

    .store-intro__copy h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 50px);
    }

    .store-intro__copy p:not(.lead) {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 2.1;
    }

    .store-intro__note {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
      background: var(--soft);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .lesson-scenes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.82fr 0.82fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .lesson-scene {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .lesson-scene .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 420px;
    }

    .lesson-scene:not(:first-child) .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 320px;
    }

    .lesson-scene__caption {
      padding: 18px 3px 0;
    }

    .lesson-scene__caption span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }

    .lesson-scene__caption strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-family: "Noto Serif JP", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .lesson-scene__caption p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .info-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(420px, 1.1fr);
      gap: 72px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .store-table {
      margin-top: 34px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .store-table__row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 138px 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 20px 2px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .store-table__row dt {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .store-table__row dd {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .dummy-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-left: 8px;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      vertical-align: 1px;
    }

    .map-placeholder {
      min-height: 510px;
      border: 1px solid #d2cbc2;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.52), rgba(255,255,255,0.52)),
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 52px, rgba(111,104,96,0.12) 52px, rgba(111,104,96,0.12) 53px),
        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #ece7df, #ece7df 52px, #e3ddd4 52px, #e3ddd4 53px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px;
    }

    .map-placeholder__pin {
      display: grid;
      width: 94px;
      height: 94px;
      place-items: center;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: "Noto Serif JP", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      transform: rotate(-45deg);
    }

    .map-placeholder__pin span {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .map-placeholder strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .map-placeholder p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .teacher-detail {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(360px, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: 82px;
    }

    .teacher-detail .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 600px;
    }

    .teacher-detail__name {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 28px 0 26px;
    }

    .teacher-detail__name strong {
      font-family: "Noto Serif JP", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .teacher-detail__name span {
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }

    .teacher-detail__message {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0 0 30px;
      padding: 28px 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: "Noto Serif JP", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 2.1;
    }

    .outing-lead {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
      gap: 72px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }

    .outing-lead__copy p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 2.1;
    }

    .outing-feature {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(330px, 0.65fr);
      min-height: 560px;
      background: var(--paper);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .outing-feature > .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 560px;
      border: 0;
    }

    .outing-feature__body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 54px 46px;
    }

    .outing-feature__body span {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.17em;
    }

    .outing-feature__body h3 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .outing-feature__body p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .outing-gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .outing-gallery .image-placeholder {
      min-height: 270px;
    }

    .course-banner {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 52px;
      padding: 44px 48px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    .course-banner h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .course-banner p {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .local-faq {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .local-faq__item {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .local-faq__item:last-child {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .local-faq__question {
      display: grid;
      width: 100%;
      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr 30px;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px 4px;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-align: left;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .local-faq__q {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .local-faq__question strong {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .local-faq__icon {
      position: relative;
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .local-faq__icon::before,
    .local-faq__icon::after {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 11px;
      height: 1px;
      content: "";
      background: var(--ink);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .local-faq__icon::after {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg);
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .local-faq__item.is-open .local-faq__icon::after {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg);
    }

    .local-faq__answer {
      display: none;
      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 0 4px 24px;
    }

    .local-faq__item.is-open .local-faq__answer {
      display: grid;
    }

    .local-faq__a {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .local-faq__answer p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .other-schools {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .other-school {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 190px;
      padding: 26px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .other-school:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .other-school span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }

    .other-school strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-family: "Noto Serif JP", "Yu Mincho", serif;
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .other-school small {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .other-school::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: 22px;
      bottom: 18px;
      content: "→";
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .mito-cta {
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .mito-cta::before {
      position: absolute;
      top: -100px;
      right: -70px;
      width: 380px;
      height: 380px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
    }

    .mito-cta .btn--accent {
      border-color: #fff;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .mito-cta .btn--accent:hover {
      border-color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .store-hero__grid,
      .store-intro,
      .info-layout,
      .teacher-detail,
      .outing-lead {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .store-hero__copy {
        padding: 70px max(28px, calc((100vw - 760px) / 2));
      }

      .store-hero__visual,
      .store-hero__visual .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 540px;
      }

      .store-facts__grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .store-fact:nth-child(2) {
        border-right: 0;
      }

      .store-fact:nth-child(-n+2) {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .store-intro__visual {
        max-width: 760px;
      }

      .lesson-scenes {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .lesson-scene:first-child {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }

      .info-layout {
        gap: 42px;
      }

      .map-placeholder {
        min-height: 440px;
      }

      .teacher-detail {
        gap: 46px;
      }

      .teacher-detail .image-placeholder {
        max-width: 680px;
        min-height: 520px;
      }

      .outing-feature {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .outing-feature > .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 470px;
      }

      .outing-gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .outing-gallery > :last-child {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }

      .course-banner {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .other-schools {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .store-hero__grid {
        min-height: auto;
      }

      .store-hero__copy {
        padding: 54px 24px 58px;
      }

      .store-hero h1 {
        font-size: 52px;
      }

      .store-hero__actions .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .store-hero__visual,
      .store-hero__visual .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 440px;
      }

      .store-hero__badge {
        right: 14px;
        bottom: 14px;
        left: 14px;
        width: auto;
      }

      .store-facts {
        box-shadow: none;
      }

      .store-facts__grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .store-fact,
      .store-fact:nth-child(2) {
        min-height: 0;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .store-fact:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      .store-intro {
        gap: 40px;
      }

      .store-intro__visual {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .store-intro__visual .image-placeholder:first-child {
        min-height: 390px;
      }

      .store-intro__visual .image-placeholder:last-child {
        display: none;
      }

      .lesson-scenes,
      .outing-gallery,
      .other-schools {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .lesson-scene:first-child,
      .outing-gallery > :last-child {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .lesson-scene .image-placeholder,
      .lesson-scene:not(:first-child) .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 350px;
      }

      .store-table__row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 5px;
      }

      .map-placeholder {
        min-height: 380px;
      }

      .teacher-detail .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 430px;
      }

      .teacher-detail__name {
        display: block;
      }

      .teacher-detail__name span {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 3px;
      }

      .teacher-detail__message {
        padding: 22px;
      }

      .outing-feature > .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 390px;
      }

      .outing-feature__body {
        padding: 34px 26px;
      }

      .outing-gallery .image-placeholder {
        min-height: 330px;
      }

      .course-banner {
        padding: 30px 24px;
      }

      .course-banner .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

  </style>
</head>

<body id="top">

  <!-- =====================================================
       COMMON HEADER / 下層ページでも共通使用想定
  ====================================================== -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="site-header__inner">
      <a class="brand" href="/wasou/" aria-label="京扇きもの教室 TOP">
        <span class="brand__mark">京扇<br>教室</span>
        <span class="brand__text">
          <strong>京扇きもの教室</strong>
          <small>KIMONO KYOSEN WASOU SCHOOL</small>
        </span>
      </a>

      <nav class="global-nav" aria-label="グローバルナビゲーション">
        <div class="global-nav__links">
          <a href="/wasou/about/">京扇きもの教室とは</a>
          <a href="/wasou/lesson/">コース・受講料</a>
          <a href="/wasou/school/" aria-current="page">教室紹介</a>
          <a href="/wasou/teacher/">講師紹介</a>
          <a href="/wasou/faq/">よくある質問</a>
        </div>
        <div class="global-nav__cta">
          <a class="header-cta" href="/wasou/contact/">お問い合わせ</a>
          <a class="header-cta header-cta--accent" href="/wasou/apply/">来店予約</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="メニューを開く" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobileMenu">
        <span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" aria-hidden="true">
    <nav class="mobile-menu__nav" aria-label="スマートフォン用ナビゲーション">
      <a href="/wasou/about/">京扇きもの教室とは</a>
      <a href="/wasou/lesson/">コース・受講料</a>
      <a href="/wasou/school/" aria-current="page">教室紹介</a>
      <a href="/wasou/teacher/">講師紹介</a>
      <a href="/wasou/faq/">よくある質問</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="mobile-menu__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--accent" href="/wasou/apply/">来店予約フォーム</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/wasou/contact/">問い合わせフォーム</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="パンくずリスト">
      <div class="container breadcrumb__inner">
        <a href="/wasou/">TOP</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span>
        <a href="/wasou/school/">教室紹介</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span>
        <span>水戸店</span>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- STORE HERO -->
    <section class="store-hero">
      <div class="store-hero__grid">
        <div class="store-hero__copy">
          <div class="store-hero__copy-inner">
            <span class="store-hero__area">IBARAKI / MITO SCHOOL</span>
            <h1>水戸店</h1>
            <div class="store-hero__sub">KIMONO KYOSEN WASOU SCHOOL</div>
            <p class="store-hero__lead">
              着物を、自分で着られる喜びを。<br>
              水戸店では、初めての方にも分かりやすく、
              一人ひとりのペースに寄り添いながら着付けを学べる教室を目指します。
            </p>
            <div class="store-hero__actions">
              <a class="btn btn--accent" href="/wasou/apply/mito/">水戸店を予約する</a>
              <a class="btn" href="#access">教室情報・アクセス</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="store-hero__visual">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <div class="image-placeholder__inner">
              <span class="image-placeholder__label">MITO MAIN IMAGE</span>
              <strong>水戸店で実際にレッスンしている様子を大きく掲載</strong>
              <p>
                明るく清潔な教室で、生徒2〜3名が鏡を見ながら着付けをしている横位置写真。<br>
                講師が少し離れた位置から穏やかにサポートし、「自分で着る」様子が伝わる自然なカット。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="store-hero__badge">
            <strong>PHOTO DIRECTION</strong>
            店舗外観ではなく「ここで習いたい」と感じる教室体験をFVに。着物の柄が映える、柔らかい自然光の写真を想定。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- QUICK FACTS -->
    <section class="store-facts" aria-label="水戸店の概要">
      <div class="container store-facts__grid">
        <div class="store-fact">
          <span>AREA</span>
          <strong>茨城県・水戸エリア</strong>
          <p>正式住所は本番情報に差し替え</p>
        </div>
        <div class="store-fact">
          <span>BEGINNER</span>
          <strong>初心者の方も歓迎</strong>
          <p>初めて着物に触れる方を想定</p>
        </div>
        <div class="store-fact">
          <span>LESSON</span>
          <strong>少人数で丁寧に</strong>
          <p>実際の定員・開講形式に差し替え</p>
        </div>
        <div class="store-fact">
          <span>RESERVATION</span>
          <strong>来店・体験予約</strong>
          <p>水戸店専用フォームへ移動</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- INTRO -->
    <section class="section section--white">
      <div class="container store-intro">
        <div class="store-intro__visual">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <div class="image-placeholder__inner">
              <span class="image-placeholder__label">CLASSROOM IMAGE 01</span>
              <strong>教室全体の雰囲気が分かる内観写真</strong>
